# The ECCO Energy Flow card's built bundle is minified/bundled third-party
# (Lit) + ECCO source, not hand-authored - esbuild preserves whitespace
# verbatim inside template-literal string content it doesn't minify,
# including a literal tab character Lit's own internals use as part of a
# whitespace-matching character class. Minifier identifier renaming
# elsewhere in the bundle can shift which physical line that lands on
# between builds, which otherwise makes `git diff --check` flag it as
# "trailing whitespace" on an unrelated line - a false positive on
# generated/vendored content, not a real formatting issue in anything
# actually authored in this repository. Excluded from the whitespace
# check rather than trimmed, since trimming could alter the literal
# string content Lit's own code depends on.
frontend/ecco-energy-flow-card/dist/*.js -whitespace
# Same Lit/esbuild false positive, same reasoning, for the Energy Actions
# card's generated bundle (its HEAD copy already carries that trailing tab;
# the 2026-09-26 Dump-to-Grid rebuild merely shifted it onto a changed line).
frontend/ecco-energy-actions-card/dist/*.js -whitespace
